    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d802">

                <pb facs="0899" n="1733" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1733"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 600.119/600</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The War Trade Board Representative in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-24T17:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 24, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5.32 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Department of State and War Trade Board:</p>
                <p>No. 8. Steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Alfonso XIII</hi> of the Spanish line
                    which arrives here in a few days has engaged to carry to Mexico 26,000 bags of
                    sugar. Have been asked to bunker her, but I disapprove using our coal for this
                    purpose. Am I authorized to refuse? I have declined to bunker all Cuban ships
                    for this purpose.</p>
                <p>In a confidential conference with the President on March 22 he informed me he was
                    in accord with my actions and expressed a wish that the Spanish boats be treated
                    in the same way.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
